  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5dccdfe5d821afd4",
      "translationZh": "推出 Grok 4.5 | SpaceXAI",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5246c56e6b439c3",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.5 是 SpaceXAI 最智能的模型，专为编程、智能体任务和知识工作而打造。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "54400b2f03480206",
      "translationZh": "免费试用 开始构建",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7740fabc2c642d0b",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们推出 Grok 4.5，这是 SpaceXAI 最智能的模型，旨在编程、智能体任务和知识工作中表现出色。它是我们迄今为止最强大的模型，并与 Cursor 一同训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "56ea94a99c6b9ed3",
      "translationZh": "卓越的实际工程能力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8872f3df28ebdbc",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.5 使用涵盖编程、科学、工程和数学知识的数据集进行训练。凭借智能且高效的推理能力，Grok 4.5 在实际工程任务中表现出色，并在这些任务上超越同类领先模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7db4add52af23a7d",
      "translationZh": "竞争对手的数据来自各开发者发布的系统卡或基准测试排行榜。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16bda775596080a2",
      "translationZh": "模型得分的基准测试条形图。DeepSWE 1.0（评测由 Datacurve 创建，AA 使用各模型提供商的评测框架运行）：Fable (max) 66.1%，GPT 5.5 (xhigh) 64.31%，Grok 4.5 62.0%，Opus 4.8 (max) 55.75%，Opus 4.7 (max) 40.12%。DeepSWE 1.1（由 Datacurve 运行 mini-swe-agent 评测框架）：Fable (max) 70%，GPT 5.5 (xhigh) 67%，Opus 4.8 (max) 59%，Grok 4.5 53%，GLM 5.2 44%。SWE Marathon 解决率（pass@1）：Grok 4.5 29.0%，Opus 4.8 (max) 26.0%，Fable (max) 24.0%，Opus 4.7 (max) 16.0%。Terminal Bench 2.1：Fable (max) 84.3%，GPT 5.5 (xhigh) 83.4%，Grok 4.5 83.3%，Opus 4.8 (max) 78.9%，Opus 4.7 (max) 78.9%。SWE Bench Pro 解决率：Fable (max) 80.4%，Opus 4.8 (max) 69.2%，Grok 4.5 64.7%，Opus 4.7 (max) 64.3%，GLM 5.2 62.1%，GPT 5.5 (xhigh) 58.6%。竞争对手的数据来自各开发者发布的系统卡或基准测试排行榜。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b68b4109c781d4c",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.5 在数万块 NVIDIA GB300 GPU 上完成训练，采用了专为大规模训练运行设计的训练与稳定性技术。除了原始 token 数量，我们还在数据过滤与整理方面投入了大量精力：通过去重、质量评分和面向特定领域的筛选，使混合数据保持广泛的覆盖面和较高的有效信息含量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd467f75ddb0fc88",
      "translationZh": "我们扩大了强化学习的规模，重点提升每个 token 的智能水平。我们的 RL 训练涵盖数十万项任务，以多步骤软件工程及其他技术工作为核心，采用自动化评分和基于模型的评分。我们的技术栈专为高度异步训练而构建，因此智能体轨迹生成可以持续运行数小时，同时数万块 GPU 上的学习仍在继续。其结果是在实际工程和智能体任务中，推理更加智能、高效。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3910ff05d3eb9fc7",
      "translationZh": "只需一条提示即可构建",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7b10f0c11554cd4",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.5 的编程能力极强，从具有挑战性的 Rust 和 C/C++ 任务，到从提示到生产部署的端到端应用构建，都能胜任。以下是该模型仅凭一条提示构建的一些示例。即使需求说明极少，Grok 4.5 也非常擅长创建精心设计、端到端功能完备的应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e577530247db3c5",
      "translationZh": "制作一个精美的宇宙与太阳系模拟。应加快模拟速度，并支持调节时间，具有逼真的运动、轨道和恒星。使用 threejs。让 HUD 具有精美的样式，并符合现代设计原则。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "02c3bebf0cdc46ba",
      "translationZh": "比 flash 模型更快",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "327a3d76d1465796",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.5 以快速模型级别的 80 TPS 速度提供服务。再加上在相同任务中，其 token 效率是最新领先模型的两倍，该模型能够更快地为你提供智能结果，且成本低得多。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33b24ff5b088edc0",
      "translationZh": "每项 SWE Bench Pro 任务的平均输出 token 数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95c956c776bf024d",
      "translationZh": "Token 效率，每项 SWE Bench Pro 任务的平均输出 token 数——Grok 4.5 解决任务平均使用 15,954 个输出 token，约为 Opus 4.8 (max) 的 67,020 个的 1/4.2",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5d0623a3709c87b3",
      "translationZh": "擅长 Office 办公任务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bcf3aa5bdb360fda",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.5 现已成为 Grok Build 中的默认模型。除了精通编程，Grok Build 还能够构建复杂的 Excel 模型，涉及网络研究、跨工作表公式使用，甚至还会留下便笺或备注，供日后参考。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7d1535e28e5e8c1a",
      "translationZh": "在 PowerPoint 和 Word 中，Grok 4.5 同样一丝不苟。该模型能够使用 PowerPoint 原生形状构建复杂图表，设计直观易懂的幻灯片内容，并在 Word 中撰写清晰的文字。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74533f922001fbcc",
      "translationZh": "拟定一份包含 5 张幻灯片的季度业务回顾大纲",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6927fb57788f6b30",
      "translationZh": "开始 插入 设计 切换 动画 审阅",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7e4834084c7e1fe",
      "translationZh": "新建幻灯片 版式 加粗 斜体 下划线 排列 设计灵感 加载项 Grok",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4e83811e98ad59f",
      "translationZh": "季度回顾 10月 · FY26",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92a3792b9c0161e5",
      "translationZh": "营收、利润率、销售管线——以及我们接下来将投资何处",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "703d89267c1bbdd9",
      "translationZh": "01 营收 02 利润率 03 销售管线 04 展望",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "151c8635decf3fd9",
      "translationZh": "第 1 张幻灯片，共 5 张 · 英语（美国）100%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc57c452e50c7fca",
      "translationZh": "了解更多关于我们适用于 Word、PowerPoint、Excel 和 Outlook 的插件的信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9a60e66ac370ea3",
      "translationZh": "与其他领先模型相比，Grok 4.5 的成本极具竞争力。Grok 4.5 的定价为每百万输入词元 2，每百万输出词元 6。该模型的词元效率也达到同类领先模型的约 2 倍，解决任务所需的步骤数不到其一半。总体而言，Grok 4.5 在单位时间和单位成本下提供了最高的智能水平。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23271e5724eb36cf",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.5 现已在 Grok Build、Cursor 的所有套餐以及 SpaceXAI 控制台中推出。只需获取一个 API 密钥，用几行代码即可开始使用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3dc5e0a504008fc6",
      "translationZh": "立即通过 SpaceXAI API 使用 Grok 4.5 开始构建。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38c3220d622b6161",
      "translationZh": "阅读文档，将 Grok 4.5 集成到你的技术栈中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "931d9292b9323e27",
      "translationZh": "在 Grok Build 中免费试用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "31622ef5e7b857eb",
      "translationZh": "我们限时提供在 Grok Build 和 Cursor 中免费使用 Grok 4.5 的机会。立即前往 x.ai/build 开始使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
